        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terry Ray, Michael York, Mickey Rooney, Dean Jones, Rhonda Fleming\n- Places: Dorothy Chandler Pavilion\n- Projects: “Hollywood Goes Classical”\n- Roles: actor, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Michael York was born Michael Hugh Johnson on 27 March 1942.\n- Michael York is an English actor and holds the honor OBE.\n- Terry Ray’s first professional writing job was the stage performance “Hollywood Goes Classical.”\n- “Hollywood Goes Classical” was staged at the Dorothy Chandler Pavilion.\n- Michael York, Mickey Rooney, Dean Jones, and Rhonda Fleming starred in “Hollywood Goes Classical” alongside several other classic film stars.",
